### Pruebas etapas 5 y 6 — panel del coach (alumnos, ficha, adherencia,
### CRUD de rutinas, asignación de rutina a alumno por día)
### Requiere: pnpm exec prisma migrate deploy && pnpm seed && pnpm dev
### Usa la extensión "REST Client" (VSCode). Corré los bloques en orden.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Login coach
# @name loginCoach
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "chino@entrenaconchino.com",
  "password": "chino1234"
}


### 2. Login alumna (para probar los 403 de rol más abajo)
# @name loginAlumna
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mica@example.com",
  "password": "chino1234"
}


##########################################################################
### Alumnos
##########################################################################

### 3. Lista de alumnos del coach (seed: Micaela y Juan)
# @name listaAlumnos
GET {{baseUrl}}/coach/students
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}


### 4. Ficha de Micaela (usa el id que devolvió la lista de arriba)
GET {{baseUrl}}/coach/students/{{listaAlumnos.response.body.$[1].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}


### 5. Alumno inexistente → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/coach/students/no-existe
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}


### 6. Rol equivocado: la alumna pegándole a /coach → 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/coach/students
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAlumna.response.body.token}}


### 7. Adherencia de Micaela, últimos 28 días (default)
GET {{baseUrl}}/coach/students/{{listaAlumnos.response.body.$[1].id}}/adherence
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}


### 8. Adherencia con rango explícito
GET {{baseUrl}}/coach/students/{{listaAlumnos.response.body.$[1].id}}/adherence?start=2026-08-01&end=2026-08-31
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}


### 9. start posterior a end → 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/coach/students/{{listaAlumnos.response.body.$[1].id}}/adherence?start=2026-08-31&end=2026-08-01
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}


##########################################################################
### Rutinas (biblioteca del coach)
##########################################################################

### 10. Crear una rutina nueva con bloques y ejercicios anidados
# @name crearRutina
POST {{baseUrl}}/coach/routines
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Piernas — Fuerza",
  "type": "FUERZA",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "letter": "A",
      "name": "Principal",
      "mode": "Series rectas",
      "estMinutes": 20,
      "note": "Dale, entrada en calor y a subir el peso de a poco.",
      "exercises": [
        { "name": "Sentadilla", "sets": 4, "reps": "6", "load": "80 kg", "restSeconds": 120 },
        { "name": "Peso muerto rumano", "sets": 3, "reps": "10", "load": "50 kg" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}


### 11. Body inválido: sin bloques → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/coach/routines
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rutina vacía",
  "type": "FUERZA",
  "blocks": []
}


### 12. type inválido → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/coach/routines
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rutina rara",
  "type": "CARDIO",
  "blocks": [{ "letter": "A", "name": "X", "exercises": [{ "name": "Y", "sets": 1, "reps": "1" }] }]
}


### 13. Listado de rutinas del coach
GET {{baseUrl}}/coach/routines
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}


### 14. Detalle de la rutina creada
GET {{baseUrl}}/coach/routines/{{crearRutina.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}


### 15. Editar sólo el nombre
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/coach/routines/{{crearRutina.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Piernas — Fuerza (v2)"
}


### 16. PATCH sin campos → 400
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/coach/routines/{{crearRutina.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}


### 17. Borrar la rutina de prueba (todavía sin asignar) → 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/coach/routines/{{crearRutina.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}


### 18. Rutina ajena/inexistente → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/coach/routines/no-existe
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}


##########################################################################
### Asignación de rutina a alumno por día
##########################################################################

### 19. Rutina de referencia: la del seed ("Tren superior — Fuerza")
# @name listaRutinas
GET {{baseUrl}}/coach/routines
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}


### 20. Asignar esa rutina a Micaela para el 2026-09-02 → 201
# @name asignar
POST {{baseUrl}}/coach/students/{{listaAlumnos.response.body.$[1].id}}/assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routineId": "{{listaRutinas.response.body.$[0].id}}",
  "date": "2026-09-02"
}


### 21. Reasignar el mismo día (sin sesión iniciada) → 200, no 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/coach/students/{{listaAlumnos.response.body.$[1].id}}/assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routineId": "{{listaRutinas.response.body.$[0].id}}",
  "date": "2026-09-02"
}


### 22. Ver la semana asignada (incluye el 2026-09-02)
GET {{baseUrl}}/coach/students/{{listaAlumnos.response.body.$[1].id}}/assignments?start=2026-09-01
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}


### 23. routineId de otro coach o inexistente → 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/coach/students/{{listaAlumnos.response.body.$[1].id}}/assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routineId": "no-existe",
  "date": "2026-09-03"
}


### 24. Desasignar el 2026-09-02 (sin sesión iniciada) → 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/coach/students/{{listaAlumnos.response.body.$[1].id}}/assignments/2026-09-02
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}


### 25. Desasignar un día sin asignación → 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/coach/students/{{listaAlumnos.response.body.$[1].id}}/assignments/2026-09-02
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}


##########################################################################
### 26-27. Guard de integridad: una vez que el alumno marcó una serie ese
### día, ni reasignar ni desasignar están permitidos (409). Para probarlo:
### 1) Asigná una rutina a una fecha nueva (bloque 20, cambiando la fecha)
### 2) Como alumna, marcá una serie ese día con
###    PUT /student/days/:date/exercises/:exerciseId/sets/1 (ver http/student.http)
### 3) Repetí los bloques 20 (reasignar) y 24 (desasignar) sobre esa fecha:
###    ambos deberían devolver 409 en vez de 200/204.


##########################################################################
### Marcas del alumno (POST/PATCH/DELETE /coach/students/:id/records)
##########################################################################

### 28. Cargar una marca nueva para Micaela → 201
# @name crearMarca
POST {{baseUrl}}/coach/students/{{listaAlumnos.response.body.$[1].id}}/records
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "exerciseName": "Sentadilla",
  "value": "90 kg",
  "note": "+10 kg en 6 semanas"
}


### 29. Repetir el mismo exerciseName → 409 (usar PATCH)
POST {{baseUrl}}/coach/students/{{listaAlumnos.response.body.$[1].id}}/records
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "exerciseName": "Sentadilla",
  "value": "92,5 kg"
}


### 30. Ficha: ahora debería incluir la marca nueva junto con la del seed
GET {{baseUrl}}/coach/students/{{listaAlumnos.response.body.$[1].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}


### 31. Actualizar el valor de la marca
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/coach/students/{{listaAlumnos.response.body.$[1].id}}/records/{{crearMarca.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": "95 kg",
  "note": "+15 kg en 8 semanas"
}


### 32. PATCH sin campos → 400
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/coach/students/{{listaAlumnos.response.body.$[1].id}}/records/{{crearMarca.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}


### 33. Marca de otro alumno / inexistente → 404
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/coach/students/{{listaAlumnos.response.body.$[1].id}}/records/no-existe
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": "1 kg"
}


### 34. Borrar la marca de prueba → 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/coach/students/{{listaAlumnos.response.body.$[1].id}}/records/{{crearMarca.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}


##########################################################################
### Editar estructura de una rutina (PATCH /coach/routines/:id con blocks)
##########################################################################

### 35. Crear una rutina de prueba (sin asignar todavía)
# @name rutinaParaEditar
POST {{baseUrl}}/coach/routines
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Full body — prueba",
  "type": "FUERZA",
  "blocks": [
    { "letter": "A", "name": "Bloque viejo", "exercises": [{ "name": "Sentadilla", "sets": 3, "reps": "10" }] }
  ]
}


### 36. Reemplazar su estructura (todavía sin uso) → 200, bloques nuevos
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/coach/routines/{{rutinaParaEditar.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "blocks": [
    { "letter": "A", "name": "Bloque nuevo", "exercises": [
      { "name": "Peso muerto", "sets": 4, "reps": "5", "load": "100 kg" },
      { "name": "Zancadas", "sets": 3, "reps": "12 por lado" }
    ]}
  ]
}


### 37. Asignarla a Micaela para poder probar el guard de "en uso"
# @name asignarParaGuard
POST {{baseUrl}}/coach/students/{{listaAlumnos.response.body.$[1].id}}/assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "routineId": "{{rutinaParaEditar.response.body.id}}",
  "date": "2026-09-10"
}


### 38. Ahora que está asignada, editar blocks → 409 (creá una rutina nueva)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/coach/routines/{{rutinaParaEditar.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "blocks": [
    { "letter": "A", "name": "Otra vez", "exercises": [{ "name": "X", "sets": 1, "reps": "1" }] }
  ]
}


### 39. Pero renombrarla (sin tocar blocks) sigue andando aunque esté en uso
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/coach/routines/{{rutinaParaEditar.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Full body — prueba (asignada)"
}


### 40. Limpieza: desasignar el 2026-09-10 y borrar la rutina de prueba
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/coach/students/{{listaAlumnos.response.body.$[1].id}}/assignments/2026-09-10
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}

###
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/coach/routines/{{rutinaParaEditar.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCoach.response.body.token}}
